// The LLVM half used to pin the lowered module line by line -- 697 CHECK lines
// of SSA numbering and insertvalue chains, which is a snapshot of MLIR's own
// lowering rather than of anything Vx decides. It had drifted badly (it still
// expected print helpers this program does not emit) and nothing noticed,
// because this runner never executed a CHECK line until Vx#407. What the file
// is actually about is trait dispatch producing one function per topology, so
// that is what it asserts.
//
// LLVM: module attributes
// LLVM: llvm.func @CPU$add_vector
// LLVM: llvm.func @NPU$add_vector
// LLVM: llvm.func @CPU$transfer_vector
// LLVM: llvm.func @NPU$transfer_vector
